  "title": "mpeg: add dissector table for PMT extended descriptors",
  "description": "This commit adds to the MPEG TS (ISO/IEC 13818-1 | Rec. ITU-T H.222.0)\nprotocol a new dissector table \"mpeg_descr.iso_ext.tag\" to allow further\ndissection of ISO Extension descriptors (tag == 0x3F) in the PMT. This\nis similar to the \"mpeg-pes.stream\" dissector table and complements the\nexisting MPEG TS protocol dissectors.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 2b05f0f7908d2815986cb559556e934987a95b17)\n\nCo-authored-by: Tim Bruylants <t.bruylants@intopix.com>",
